      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140535371324_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140535371324_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140535371324_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a556fbbd2791native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英格兰vs阿根廷裁判安排：美国裁判伊斯梅尔·埃尔法思执法</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140710356195.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140710356195.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140710356195.jpg"> </div><p>国际足联官方公布了世界杯半决赛英格兰对阵阿根廷的执法裁判组，美国裁判组执法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a5516cfa81cbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：欧足联不会采用世界杯“罚错人”新规，VAR仅可介入第二黄</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a5309f3b3fdc_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a5309f3b3fdc_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a5309f3b3fdc_720.jpg"> </div><p>据《泰晤士》报道，欧足联不会采用世界杯期间的VAR新规，即VAR不会介入“罚错人”的黄牌判罚。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a550796af313native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：法国vs西班牙世界杯半决赛前，现场将为尼斯恐袭默哀1分钟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/6a5509063e3e1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/6a5509063e3e1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260713/6a5509063e3e1.jpg"> </div><p>法国足协官方宣布，在法国vs西班牙的世界杯半决赛前，现场将进行一分钟的默哀仪式，悼念十年前的尼斯恐怖袭击事件。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a54fd4d3a147native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">19岁身家千万！罗体：亚马尔个人净资产预估已达4300万美元</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260707/6a4c0915ee909_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260707/6a4c0915ee909.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260707/6a4c0915ee909.jpg"> </div><p>亚马尔本月迎来19岁生日，据《罗马体育报》表示，尽管年纪尚轻，但他已是本届世界杯上最富有的球员之一，拥有令人瞠目结舌的身家。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a555fa7cb786native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">创造历史！挪威队回国后受到热烈欢迎，全队被挪威国王接见</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.66" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140640084049.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140640084049.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140640084049.jpg"> </div><p><span style=" 0, 0);">挪威队回国后受到球迷们的热烈欢迎，并被挪威国王接见。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a55667466e4cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">走红！吕尔松穿人字拖与挪威国王见面，还在社媒晒穿拖鞋照</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.98" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140632369204_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.98" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.98" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140632369204_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140632369204_720.jpg"> </div><p>挪威全队今天回到奥斯陆，在王宫接受了挪威国王的接见，吕尔松穿着一双人字拖引发热议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-13/6a550218db7e9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队报：法国晋级半决赛，法国名哨莱特西耶和蒂尔潘提前告别世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260603/6a202d396575d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260603/6a202d396575d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260603/6a202d396575d.jpg"> </div><p>《队报》报道，随着法国队晋级世界杯半决赛，法国名哨莱特西耶和蒂尔潘将不再执法本届赛事剩余的比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a551194e7d92native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">OPTA：本届世界杯只有2名前锋在单场比赛中步行超5公里，都是梅西</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/6a4845c83c8fd_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/6a4845c83c8fd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260704/6a4845c83c8fd.jpg"> </div><p>OPTA统计表明，2026年世界杯上，只有两名前锋在单场比赛中步行距离达到了5公里，两人都是梅西。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a55135b5858cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：英格兰vs阿根廷最低票价飙到3000美元 法西战价格持续走低</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260509/69ff12878af84.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260509/69ff12878af84.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260509/69ff12878af84.jpg"> </div><p>TA报道，英格兰队对阵阿根廷队的比赛成为了球迷争相抢购的焦点，而法国队对阵西班牙队的比赛则显得相对冷清。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a551f27938f7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">特里：贝林厄姆的表现让我想起齐达内 不觉得阿根廷比英格兰强</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.34" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240422/662649bc8823a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" da