n" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a53004868ee8.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a53004868ee8.jpg"> </div><p>梅西本应在约21年前就与英格兰正面交锋，但因其在阿根廷的首秀中登场47秒染红，最终梅西在对阵英格兰的比赛被禁赛无缘交手。</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a551c3fea087native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷队官博：有心捐赠物资助力广西灾后建设，回馈中国球迷支持</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2.29" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140140334466.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2.29" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2.29" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140140334466_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140140334466_720.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷国家足球队官方微博发布声明，表示球队已关注到中国广西洪水灾情，有心捐赠一批国家队官方物资，助力当地灾后恢复建设。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-14/6a5544353d926native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：特罗萨德将加盟贝西克塔斯，转会费总价2000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260714/202607140402555302_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 